<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>明墨 Junior 財商小學堂</title>
<meta name="description" content="給小朋友的理財入門：錢從哪裡來、需要還是想要、三個存錢罐、存錢小目標。明墨管理顧問 Junior 財商小學堂。">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@500;700;900&family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/junior.css">
</head>
<body>
{% raw %}
<header class="jhead"><div class="wrap jbar">
<a class="wm" href="#top" aria-label="明墨 Junior 財商小學堂"><span class="mm">明墨<span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="bar" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="jr"><b>JUNIOR</b><small>財商小學堂</small></span></a>
<a class="back" href="/">回到明墨</a>
</div></header>
<main id="top">
<section class="wrap hero">
<div class="hero-t">
<p class="tag">5 分鐘財商探險</p>
<h1>錢是怎麼一回事？</h1>
<p class="lead">跟著小太陽闖四關，搞懂錢從哪裡來、怎麼分、怎麼存</p>
<div><a class="btn" href="#lv1">開始探險</a></div>
</div>
<svg class="ill" viewBox="-14 -14 148 148" role="img" aria-label="明墨 Logo 繪本版：圓框裡的兩座山和太陽"><defs><clipPath id="jc"><circle cx="60" cy="62" r="44"/></clipPath></defs><circle cx="60" cy="62" r="44" fill="#BFE6F7"/><g clip-path="url(#jc)"><path d="M14 40 a5 5 0 0 1 7 -4 a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 12 1 a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 7 L14 44 Z" fill="#FFFBF2" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1"/><polygon points="40,121 82,50 126,121" fill="#8E8B84" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><polygon points="82,50 75.5,61 79,59.5 82,63 85.5,59.5 88.5,61" fill="#FFFBF2" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/><polygon points="-2,121 44,38 92,121" fill="#2E3135" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><polygon points="44,38 36.5,51.5 40.5,49.5 44,54 47.5,49.5 51.5,51.5" fill="#FFFBF2" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/><rect x="10" y="100" width="100" height="12" fill="#9AD67E"/></g><circle cx="60" cy="62" r="44" fill="none" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="88" cy="28" r="19.5" fill="#FFF7E8"/><g class="sun-g"><g stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="109.0" y1="28.0" x2="115.0" y2="28.0"/><line x1="102.8" y1="42.8" x2="107.1" y2="47.1"/><line x1="88.0" y1="49.0" x2="88.0" y2="55.0"/><line x1="73.2" y1="42.8" x2="68.9" y2="47.1"/><line x1="67.0" y1="28.0" x2="61.0" y2="28.0"/><line x1="73.2" y1="13.2" x2="68.9" y2="8.9"/><line x1="88.0" y1="7.0" x2="88.0" y2="1.0"/><line x1="102.8" y1="13.2" x2="107.1" y2="8.9"/></g><circle cx="88" cy="28" r="16" fill="#FFC845" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="1.4"/></g></svg>
</section>
<nav class="wrap map" aria-label="關卡"><a href="#lv1"><span>1</span>錢從哪裡來</a><a href="#lv2"><span>2</span>需要還是想要</a><a href="#lv3"><span>3</span>三個存錢罐</a><a href="#lv4"><span>4</span>存錢小目標</a></nav>

<section class="lv" id="lv1"><div class="wrap">
<div class="lvh"><div class="lvn"><small>關卡</small><b>1</b></div><div><h2>錢從哪裡來？</h2><p>錢不會從提款機自己跑出來喔</p></div></div>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="card"><span class="chip" style="background:var(--sun)">工作</span><h3>努力工作換來的</h3><p>爸爸媽媽用時間和本事工作，公司付給他們薪水，這就是家裡的錢</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="chip" style="background:var(--sky)">交換</span><h3>用來交換東西</h3><p>錢就像大家都同意的「交換券」，可以換到食物、衣服，也可以換到別人的幫忙</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="chip" style="background:var(--leaf)">有限</span><h3>數量是有限的</h3><p>每個月賺到的錢是固定的，所以要想清楚：什麼先買、什麼可以等</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="lv sky" id="lv2"><div class="wrap">
<div class="lvh"><div class="lvn"><small>關卡</small><b>2</b></div><div><h2>需要還是想要？</h2><p>「需要」是沒有它會很困擾；「想要」是有了很開心，但沒有也沒關係</p></div></div>
<div class="quiz">
<div class="card qcard" aria-live="polite">
<p class="ask">這個是…</p>
<p class="item" id="qItem">午餐便當</p>
<div class="qbtns" id="qBtns"><button class="btn need" type="button" data-a="need">需要</button><button class="btn want" type="button" data-a="want">想要</button></div>
<p class="fb" id="qFb"></p>
<p class="score" id="qScore">答對 0 / 8</p>
</div>
<div class="bins">
<div class="card bin need"><h3>需要</h3><ul id="binNeed"></ul></div>
<div class="card bin want"><h3>想要</h3><ul id="binWant"></ul></div>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="lv" id="lv3"><div class="wrap">
<div class="lvh"><div class="lvn"><small>關卡</small><b>3</b></div><div><h2>三個存錢罐</h2><p>拿到零用錢，先分成三份再使用</p></div></div>
<div class="jars-in"><label for="allow">我這週的零用錢</label><input class="num" id="allow" type="number" min="0" step="10" value="200" inputmode="numeric"><span>元</span></div>
<div class="jars">
<div class="card jar save"><div class="pot"><div class="fill" id="fSave"></div></div><p class="amt" id="aSave">100</p><h3>存起來 50%</h3><p>為了以後更大的目標</p></div>
<div class="card jar spend"><div class="pot"><div class="fill" id="fSpend"></div></div><p class="amt" id="aSpend">80</p><h3>花掉 40%</h3><p>買現在需要或想要的東西</p></div>
<div class="card jar share"><div class="pot"><div class="fill" id="fShare"></div></div><p class="amt" id="aShare">20</p><h3>分享 10%</h3><p>送禮物或幫助別人</p></div>
</div>
<p class="note">比例只是一個例子，可以和爸爸媽媽一起決定最適合自己的分法</p>
</div></section>

<section class="lv leaf" id="lv4"><div class="wrap">
<div class="lvh"><div class="lvn"><small>關卡</small><b>4</b></div><div><h2>存錢小目標</h2><p>想買的東西，算算看要存幾週</p></div></div>
<div class="card goal">
<div class="fields">
<label class="field" for="gName">我想買<input class="num" id="gName" type="text" value="故事書" style="width:100%;font-family:var(--tc)"></label>
<label class="field" for="gPrice">它要多少錢（元）<input class="num" id="gPrice" type="number" min="1" step="10" value="360" inputmode="numeric"></label>
<label class="field" for="gWeek">我每週存多少（元）<input class="num" id="gWeek" type="number" min="1" step="10" value="100" inputmode="numeric"></label>
</div>
<div class="result" aria-live="polite">
<p style="font-weight:700" id="gText">存到故事書需要</p>
<p class="weeks"><span id="gWeeks">4</span> 週</p>
<div class="track" aria-hidden="true"><i id="gBar" style="width:25%"></i></div>
<p id="gTip" style="font-weight:700">第 1 週先存到 100 元，已經完成 28%！</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="rem"><div class="wrap">
<div class="card">先存再花，想要的東西可以等一等</div>
<p class="sm">今天闖關完成！把這句話說給家人聽吧</p>
</div></section>

<section class="wrap par">
<div class="card"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="pm"><circle cx="60" cy="62" r="44"/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path="url(#pm)"><polygon points="40,120 82,50 126,120" fill="#8E8B84"/><polygon points="-2,120 44,38 92,120" fill="#2E3135"/></g><circle cx="60" cy="62" r="44" fill="none" stroke="#2E3135" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="88" cy="28" r="16" fill="#C9A45C" stroke="#FFFBF2" stroke-width="6"/></svg><div><h2>給爸爸媽媽</h2><p>明墨 Junior 財商小學堂提供兒童與親子財商課程，用遊戲和生活例子，陪孩子建立一輩子受用的金錢觀</p></div><a class="btn alt" href="/contact/">詢問課程</a></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="jf"><div class="wrap"><span>© 2026 明墨管理顧問</span><span>明墨 Junior 財商小學堂</span></div></footer>
<script>
(function(){
var items=[["午餐便當","need"],["最新的電動遊戲","want"],["學校的課本","need"],["第五隻娃娃","want"],["下雨天的雨傘","need"],["手搖飲料","want"],["喝的水","need"],["閃亮貼紙","want"]];
var i=0,score=0,item=document.getElementById("qItem"),fb=document.getElementById("qFb"),sc=document.getElementById("qScore"),bn=document.getElementById("binNeed"),bw=document.getElementById("binWant");
function show(){if(i>=items.length){item.textContent="全部完成！";document.getElementById("qBtns").hidden=true;fb.textContent="你分對了 "+score+" 個，太厲害了";return}item.textContent=items[i][0]}
document.querySelectorAll("#qBtns .btn").forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener("click",function(){
var it=items[i];if(!it)return;var ok=b.dataset.a===it[1];if(ok)score++;
fb.textContent=ok?"答對了！":(it[1]==="need"?"再想想：沒有它會很困擾，所以是「需要」":"再想想：沒有它也沒關係，所以是「想要」");
var li=document.createElement("li");li.textContent=it[0];(it[1]==="need"?bn:bw).appendChild(li);
i++;sc.textContent="答對 "+score+" / "+items.length;show();})});
show();
var al=document.getElementById("allow");
function jars(){var v=Math.max(0,Number(al.value)||0);var s=Math.round(v*.5),p=Math.round(v*.4),h=v-s-p;
[["Save",s,.5],["Spend",p,.4],["Share",h,.1]].forEach(function(x){document.getElementById("a"+x[0]).textContent=x[1];document.getElementById("f"+x[0]).style.height=(v?Math.max(12,x[2]*140):0)+"%"})}
al.addEventListener("input",jars);jars();
var gn=document.getElementById("gName"),gp=document.getElementById("gPrice"),gw=document.getElementById("gWeek");
function goal(){var p=Math.max(0,Number(gp.value)||0),w=Math.max(0,Number(gw.value)||0),n=gn.value.trim()||"目標";
document.getElementById("gText").textContent="存到"+n+"需要";
if(!p||!w){document.getElementById("gWeeks").textContent="?";document.getElementById("gTip").textContent="填入價錢和每週存多少，就能算出來";document.getElementById("gBar").style.width="0%";return}
var k=Math.ceil(p/w);document.getElementById("gWeeks").textContent=k;
var pct=Math.min(100,Math.round(w/p*100));document.getElementById("gBar").style.width=pct+"%";
document.getElementById("gTip").textContent=k<=1?"一週就能存到，真棒！":"第 1 週先存到 "+w+" 元，已經完成 "+pct+"%！";}
[gn,gp,gw].forEach(function(e){e.addEventListener("input",goal)});goal();
})();
</script>
{% endraw %}
<script>(function(){var nav=performance.getEntriesByType&&(performance.getEntriesByType('navigation')[0]||{}).type;if(nav==='back_forward')return;
function go(){try{var id=decodeURIComponent(location.hash.slice(1)),t=id&&document.getElementById(id);
if(t){t.scrollIntoView({block:'start'})}else if(!id){scrollTo(0,0);document.body.scrollIntoView({block:'start'})}}catch(e){}}
go();addEventListener('load',function(){setTimeout(go,60)},{once:true})})();</script>
</body>
</html>
